  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐竟然会特地来见我……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我要用宝可梦对战来表达\n这份感动与感激之情！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D07ADF71364F1A72795730676589C162112026202600100001BE01000A6211898175285B9D53EF68A65BF96218676588688FBE000A8FD94EFD611F52A84E0E611F6FC04E4B60C5FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你没有找由紫小姐，而是找我搭话，\n这一点值得称赞啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那我们就开始对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F606CA16709627E75317D2B5C0F59D0FF0C800C662F627E6211642D8BDDFF0C000A8FD94E0070B9503C5F9779F08D5E554A300200100001BE00000A90A362114EEC5C315F0059CB5BF962185427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等！既然你们有两个人，\n那我也要帮<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>的忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B49FF0165E271364F604EEC67094E244E2A4EBAFF0C000A90A362114E5F89815E2E001000020100000076845FD93002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你都准备好了，\n就直接开始宝可梦对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6090FD51C65907597D4E86FF0C000A5C3176F463A55F0059CB5B9D53EF68A65BF962185427FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开始吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F0059CB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟这是个让人莫名其妙的状况嘛。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等你做好心理准备后，\n就和MSBC的那两个人说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF8FD9662F4E2A8BA94EBA83AB540D51765999768472B651B5561B300200100001BE01000A7B494F60505A597D5FC3740651C65907540EFF0C000A5C31548C004D005300420043768490A34E244E2A4EBA8BF44E0058F054273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让MSBC的那两个人\n见识一下我们超Z队的厉害吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA9004D005300420043768490A34E244E2A4EBA000A89C18BC64E004E0B62114EEC8D85005A961F768453895BB35427FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n请和我对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A8BF7548C62115BF96218300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你会和我对战的是吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604F1A548C62115BF962187684662F5427FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稍等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A0D7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你可真会吊人胃口……\n我会等你同意和我们对战的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6053EF771F4F1A540A4EBA80C353E320262026000A62114F1A7B494F60540C610F548C62114EEC5BF962187684FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有春紫在，\n就意味着胜利是属于我们的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670966257D2B5728FF0C000A5C31610F5473774080DC5229662F5C5E4E8E62114EEC7684FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和你对战是注定的！\n就算你说不要也是白搭哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C4F605BF96218662F6CE85B9A7684FF01000A5C317B974F608BF44E0D89814E5F662F767D642D54E6300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好～！\n我一定要比由紫小姐表现得更活跃。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF5EFF01000A62114E005B9A89816BD475317D2B5C0F59D0886873B05F9766F46D3B8DC3300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你准备好对战了，\n就和MSBC的那两个人说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6051C65907597D5BF962184E86FF0C000A5C31548C004D005300420043768490A34E244E2A4EBA8BF44E0058F054273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "引导大众正是我等\n名流的职责呀，皮可西！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F155BFC59274F176B63662F62117B49000A540D6D417684804C8D235440FF0C76AE53EF897FFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拿出我们的看家本领！\n超级进化，大闹一场咯，毒藻龙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62FF51FA62114EEC7684770B5BB6672C9886FF01000A8D857EA78FDB5316FF0C592795F94E00573A54AFFF0C6BD285FB9F99FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝石海星，\n展示我们矫健的舞步吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D77F36D77661FFF0C000A5C55793A62114EEC77EB50657684821E6B6554273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇～赢了！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，我们赢了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C7FF5E8D624E86FF01000A0010000201000000FF0C62114EEC8D624E86FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐就无需多言了，\n玳萝小姐的宝石海星动作也很惊人！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D05C3165E09700591A8A004E86FF0C000A73B3841D5C0F59D076845B9D77F36D77661F52A84F5C4E5F5F8860CA4EBAFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D0300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "会跳舞的人核心力量强，\n而且擅长控制身体，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n因此具备格斗技的素质。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n进一步说，训练家本身的实力\n会关系到搭档宝可梦的动作。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F1A8DF3821E76844EBA68385FC3529B91CF5F3AFF0C000A800C4E1464C5957F63A752368EAB4F53FF0C00100001BE00000A56E06B6451775907683C6597628076847D208D28300200100001BE01000A8FDB4E006B658BF4FF0C8BAD7EC35BB6672C8EAB76845B9E529B000A4F1A51737CFB5230642D68635B9D53EF68A6768452A84F5C300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐要不要\n趁这个机会做一下舞蹈特训呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D089814E0D8981000A8D818FD94E2A673A4F1A505A4E004E0B821E8E4872798BAD5462FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你呀……明明知道\n我没有节奏感还问这个。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60544020262026660E660E77E59053000A62116CA167098282594F611F8FD895EE8FD94E2A300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我来教你吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A36211676565594F605427FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……谢谢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620268C228C22300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n这是你获胜的证明。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A8FD9662F4F6083B780DC76848BC1660E300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n由紫装扮连衣裙！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A75317D2B88C5626E8FDE886388D9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>和由紫穿同一款？\n异次元密阿雷还真是无奇不有啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000548C75317D2B7A7F540C4E006B3EFF1F000A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F78FD8771F662F65E059474E0D6709554AFF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是异次元的由紫在意\n自己没有节奏感的话，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那现实的由紫会不会也一样呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F5F026B215143768475317D2B5728610F000A81EA5DF16CA167098282594F611F76848BDDFF0C00100001BE00000A90A373B05B9E768475317D2B4F1A4E0D4F1A4E5F4E0068375462FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一直以来，我连社交舞……\n都尽可能地避开了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0076F44EE56765FF0C62118FDE793E4EA4821E20262026000A90FD5C3D53EF80FD5730907F5F004E86300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我平时也喜好跳舞，\n如果由紫小姐不介意的话，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要不要和我学一下？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E7365F64E5F559C597D8DF3821EFF0C000A5982679C75317D2B5C0F59D04E0D4ECB610F76848BDDFF0C00100001BE00000A89814E0D8981548C62115B664E004E0BFF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    }
  ],
